-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September ran 70% of normal and November to December 67%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 179% of normal on the middle. Grid 12755 had its driest year in 2000 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
